        <div class="evolution-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">1995</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Windows 95</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Start button revolution</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2001</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Windows XP</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Luna visual refresh</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2009</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Windows 7</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Aero Glass perfection</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="evolution-summary">
        From simple Program Manager to sophisticated Aero Glass, Windows evolved from
        basic windowing to a complete desktop environment with rich visual effects.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Mac Evolution -->
    <div class="evolution-card">
      <h3 class="evolution-title">
        <span class="evolution-icon">🍎</span>
        Mac Evolution
      </h3>
      <div class="evolution-timeline">
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">1991</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">System 7</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Classic Mac perfected</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">1999</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Mac OS 9</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Platinum interface</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-arrow">→</div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2001</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Mac OS X</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Aqua revolution</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="evolution-summary">
        The dramatic shift from Classic Mac OS to OS X with Aqua interface marked one of
        the biggest design transformations in computing history.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Linux/Mobile/Alternative -->
    <div class="evolution-card">
      <h3 class="evolution-title">
        <span class="evolution-icon">🌟</span>
        Alternative Systems
      </h3>
      <div class="evolution-timeline">
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2000</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">BeOS R5</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Media OS innovation</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2004</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">Ubuntu Warty</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Linux for humans</div>
        </div>
        <div class="evolution-step">
          <div class="evolution-year">2007</div>
          <div class="evolution-name">iOS 1.0</div>
          <div class="evolution-note">Touch revolution</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="evolution-summary">
        BeOS showed what could be possible with pervasive multithreading, Ubuntu brought
        Linux to the mainstream, and iOS revolutionized mobile computing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

